OL,3,GNEWSANew stone skimming champions
OL,4,Abattle strong gusts for glory
OL,5,
OL,6,FNew stone skimming champions battled
OL,7,Fpowerful gales and long ferry queues to
OL,8,Ftake home the sport's top prize on a
OL,9,Ftiny Scottish island.
OL,11,FThe world championship returned to the
OL,12,Fisle of Easdale, in the inner Hebrides,
OL,13,Fon Saturday with a record number of
OL,14,Finternational entries.
OL,16,FToss Master Kyle Mathews, co-organiser
OL,17,Fof the event, said the strong gusts
OL,18,Fshortened throwing distances which
OL,19,F"only made it more competitive" than
OL,20,Fprevious years.
OL,23,APub: 07-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
