OL,3,GNEWSANew stone skimming champions
OL,4,Abattle strong gusts for glory
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe told BBC Radio Scotland Breakfast it
OL,7,Fwas the busiest year in the contest's
OL,8,Fhistory, with about 2,000 spectators on
OL,9,Fthe island which has a population of
OL,10,F60.
